# Build artefacts and installs are rebuilt inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/dist-test
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# Local databases and secrets never enter the build context.
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/.env*
# Python caches and virtualenvs.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
# Test output.
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/coverage
# Repo plumbing the runtime does not need.
.git
worktrees
evidence
specs
# Last so it wins over **/.env* above: the documented example is safe to ship.
!.env.example
